{"version":1,"slug":"Oliiveboardd__Reasoning_Super_Prac__Reasoning_Mock_102_-_Mathematical_Operations","path":"Oliiveboardd/Reasoning Super Prac/Reasoning Mock 102 - Mathematical Operations.html","title":"devgagan","provider":"Oliiveboardd","category":"Reasoning Super Prac","durationMinutes":60,"totalQuestions":20,"sectionsLocked":false,"sections":null,"questions":[{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If + means - , &div; means  X , - means &div; and  X  means +, then find the value of the following expression:</p><p>40 + 4  X  7 &div; 9 - 3</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; + &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; - , &div; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; X , - &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; &div; &#2324;&#2352; X &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; + &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;:</p><p>40 + 4 X 7 &div; 9 - 3</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">31</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">31</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">68</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">68</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">74</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">74</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">57</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">57</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>40 + 4  X  7 &div; 9 - 3</p><p>After interchanging of sign: (Using BODMAS)</p><p>= 40 - 4 + 7  X  9 &div; 3</p><p>= 40  -  4 + 7  X  3</p><p>= 40  -  4 + 21</p><p>= 36 + 21</p><p>= 57</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which two signs should be interchanged to make the given equation correct?</p><p>42  X  7 + 6  -  5 &div; 2 = 2</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>42 X 7 + 6 - 5 &div; 2 = 2</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">X , &div;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">X , &div;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">X , +</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">X , +</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">- , X</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">- , X</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">- , +</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">- , +</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>From (a):</p><p>42  X  7 + 6  -  5 &div; 2 = 2</p><p>After interchange of sign:</p><p>42 &div; 7 + 6  -  5  X  2 = 2</p><p>6 + 6  -  10 = 2</p><p>12  -  10 = 2</p><p>2 = 2</p><p>LHS = RHS</p><p>From (b):</p><p>42  X  7 + 6  -  5 &div; 2 = 2</p><p>After interchange of sign:</p><p>42 + 7  X  6  -  5 &div; 2 = 2</p><p>42 + 42  -  2.5 = 2</p><p>So, LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>From (c):</p><p>42  X  7 + 6  -  5 &div; 2 = 2</p><p>After interchange of sign:</p><p>42 - 7 + 6  X  5 &div; 2 = 2</p><p>42  -  7 + 15 = 2</p><p>35 + 15 = 2</p><p>So, LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>From (d):</p><p>42  X  7 + 6  -  5 &div; 2 = 2</p><p>After interchange of sign:</p><p>42  X  7 - 6 + 5 &div; 2 = 2</p><p>294  -  6 + 2.5 = 2</p><p>294  -  3.5 = 2</p><p>So, LHS is not equal to RHS.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If &div; means +,  X  means -, - means &div; and + means  X , then find the value of the following expression.</p><p>7 + 8 &div; 5  X  36 - 9</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &div; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; + &#2361;&#2376; , X &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; - &#2361;&#2376;, - &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; &div; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; + &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; X &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>7 + 8 &div; 5 X 36 - 9</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">99</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">99</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">57</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">57</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">41</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">41</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">19</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">19</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>7 + 8 &div; 5  X  36 - 9</p><p>After interchange of sign: (Using BODMAS)</p><p>= 7  X  8 + 5 - 36 &div; 9</p><p>= 56 + 5  -  4</p><p>= 57</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the correct combination of mathematical signs that can sequentially replace the * signs and balance the given equation.</p><p>35 * 12 * 4 * 15 * 2 * 8</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2327;&#2339;&#2367;&#2340;&#2368;&#2351; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; * &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2346;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2340;&#2369;&#2354;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>35 * 12 * 4 * 15 * 2 * 8</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">+, &div;, -, x, =</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+, &div;, -, x, =</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-, &div;, +, x, =</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-, &div;, +, x, =</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">+, &div;, -, -, =</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+, &div;, -, -, =</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-, &div;, -, +, =</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-, &div;, -, +, =</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>From option a:</p><p>35 + 12 &div; 4  -  15 x 2 = 8</p><p>35 + 3  -  30 = 8</p><p>5 +3 = 8</p><p>8 = 8</p><p>LHS = RHS</p><p>From option b:</p><p>35 - 12 &div; 4 + 15 x 2 = 8</p><p>35 - 3 + 30 = 8</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS</p><p>From option c:</p><p>35 + 12 &div; 4 - 15 - 2 = 8</p><p>35 + 3  -  15 -2 = 8</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS</p><p>From option d:</p><p>35 - 12 &div; 4 - 15 + 2 = 8</p><p>35  -  3  -  15 + 2 = 8</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 'x' means 'minus', '+' means 'divided by', '&div;' means 'multiplied by' and ' - ' means 'add', then find the value of the expression given below.</p><p>7  -  13 &div; 4 x [{(24 &div; 2 x 16) &div; 3} + 16] + 2</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 'x' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '&#2328;&#2335;&#2366;&#2357;' &#2361;&#2376;, '+' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '&#2349;&#2366;&#2327;' &#2361;&#2376;, '&div;' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '&#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2366;' &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; ' - ' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '&#2332;&#2379;&#2396;' &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>7 - 13 &div; 4 x [{(24 &div; 2 x 16) &div; 3} + 16] + 2</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">24</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">24</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">56</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">56</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">48</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">48</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">36</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">36</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Here, x means  -</p><p>+ means &div;</p><p>&div; means x</p><p>And,  -  means +</p><p>7  -  13 &div; 4 x [{(24 &div; 2 x 16) &div; 3} + 16] + 2</p><p>= 7 + 13 x 4  -  [{(24 x 2  -  16) x 3} &div; 16] &div; 2</p><p>= 7 + 52  -  [{(48  -  16) x 3} &div; 16] &div; 2</p><p>= 59  -  [{32 x 3} &div; 16] &div; 2</p><p>= 59  -  [96 &div; 16] &div; 2</p><p>= 59  -  6 &div; 2</p><p>= 59  -  3</p><p>= <b>56</b></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If L is coded as '&div;', M is coded as '+', N is coded as ' X ' and K is coded as '-', then what is the value of 65M128L8N16K92?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; L &#2325;&#2379; '&div;' &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, M &#2325;&#2379; '+' &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, N &#2325;&#2379; ' X ' &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; K &#2325;&#2379; '-' &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379;&#2337;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 65M128L8N16K92 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">229</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">229</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">332</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">332</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">216</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">216</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">321</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">321</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>It becomes,</p><p>65 + 128 &div; 8  X  16  -  92 = 65 + 16 X  16  -  92 = 65 + 256  -  92 = 229</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which two symbols need to be interchanged to make the given equation correct?</p><p>90 &div; 45 + 15  -  60  X  30 = 0</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2310;&#2357;&#2358;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>90 &div; 45 + 15 - 60 X 30 = 0</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">+ and X</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+ &#2324;&#2352; X</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&div; and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div; &#2324;&#2352; -</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">X and &div;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">X &#2324;&#2352; &div;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">+ and -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+ &#2324;&#2352; -</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Option (a): Interchange + and  X </p><p>90 &div; 45  X  15  -  60 + 30 = 0</p><p>30  -  60 + 30 = 0</p><p>-30 + 30 = 0</p><p><b>0 = 0</b></p><p>LHS is equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (a) is correct.</p><p>Option (b): Interchange &div; and  - </p><p>90  -  45 + 15 &div; 60  X  30 = 0</p><p>90  -  45 + 7.5 = 0</p><p>90  -  37.5 = 0</p><p>52.5 &#8800; 0</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (b) is incorrect.</p><p>Option (c): Interchange  X  and &div;</p><p>90  X  45 + 15  -  60 &div; 30 = 0</p><p>4050 + 15  -  2 = 0</p><p>4063 &#8800; 0</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (c) is incorrect.</p><p>Option (d): Interchange + and  - </p><p>90 &div; 45  -  15 + 60  X  30 = 0</p><p>2  -  15 + 1800 = 0</p><p>1787 &#8800; 0</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (d) is incorrect.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which two numbers should be interchanged to make the given equation correct? </p><p>69 &div; 15 + 12 &div; 2  X  3  -  47 = 66</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>69 &div; 15 + 12 &div; 2 X 3 - 47 = 66</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">12 and 15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">12 &#2324;&#2352; 15</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3 and 12</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3 &#2324;&#2352; 12</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">15 and 3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">15 &#2324;&#2352; 3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">47 and 69</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">47 &#2324;&#2352; 69</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Option a) 69 &div; 12 + 15 &div; 2  X  3  -  47</p><p>= 5.75 + 7.5  X  3  -  47 = -18.75</p><p>Option b) 69 &div; 15 + 3 &div; 2  X  12  -  47</p><p>= 4.6 + 1.5  X  12  -  47 = -24.4</p><p>Option c) 69 &div; 3 + 12 &div; 2  X  15  -  47</p><p>= 23 + 6  X  15  -  47 = 113  -  47 = 66</p><p>Option d) 47 &div; 15 + 12 &div; 2  X  3  -  69</p><p>= 3.1 + 18  -  69 = -47.9</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If '#' means 'subtraction', '&amp;' means 'addition', '%' means 'division' and '@' means 'multiplication', then find the value of the following expression. </p><p>63 % 9 @ 17 # 20 &amp; 5 </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; '#' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '&#2328;&#2335;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;' &#2361;&#2376;, '&amp;' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '&#2332;&#2379;&#2396;&#2344;&#2366;' &#2361;&#2376;, '%' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '&#2349;&#2366;&#2327; &#2342;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366;' &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; '@' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '&#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366;' &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>63 % 9 @ 17 # 20 &amp; 5</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">104</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">104</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">140</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">140</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">106</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">106</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">112</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">112</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>It is given that, </p><p>'#' means 'subtraction',</p><p>'&amp;' means 'addition', </p><p>'%' means 'division' </p><p>'@' means 'multiplication'</p><p>After decoding, we get: 63 &div; 9  X  17 - 20 + 5 </p><p>= 7  X  17 - 20 + 5 </p><p>= 119  -  20 + 5 </p><p>= 104</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In the given question, which two signs should be interchanged to make the given equation correct? </p><p><b>27 x 9 - 5 + 8 &div; 2 = 14 </b></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p><b>27 x 9 - 5 + 8 &div; 2 = 14 </b></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">&div;, +</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div;, +</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">+, -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+, -</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&div;, x</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div;, x</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">x, -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">x, -</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>From a); </p><p>27 x 9 - 5 &div; 8 + 2 = 244.375 &#8800; 14 </p><p>From b); </p><p>27 x 9 + 5 - 8 &div; 2 = 244 &#8800; 14 </p><p>From c); </p><p><b>27 &div; 9 - 5 + 8 x 2 = 3 - 5 + 16 = 14</b></p><p>From d); </p><p>27 - 9 x 5 + 8 &div; 2 = -14 &#8800; 14 </p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If '-' means '+', 'x' means '&div;', '+' means '-', and '&div;' means 'x', then what will come in place of the question mark (?) in the following equation? </p><p><b>26 &div; 5 - 2 &div; 8 x 4 + 63 - 9 = ?</b></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; '-' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '+', 'x' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '&div;', '+' &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; '-' &#2324;&#2352