;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2339;&#2367;&#2340;&#2368;&#2351; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>204 * 12 * 6 * 34 * 17 = 119</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">&div;, X , +, -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div;, X , +, -</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">- , &div;, X , +</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">- , &div;, X , +</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">+, X , - , &div;</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">+, X , - , &div;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">&div;, +, X , -</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&div;, +, X , -</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Option (a): &div;,  X , +,  - </p><p>204 &div; 12  X  6 + 34  -  17 = 119</p><p>102 + 34  -  17 = 119</p><p><b>119 = 119</b></p><p>LHS is equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (a) is correct.</p><p>Option (b):  - , &div;,  X , +</p><p>204  -  12 &div; 6  X  34 + 17 = 119</p><p>204  -  68 + 17 = 119</p><p>153 &#8800; 119</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (b) is incorrect.</p><p>Option (c): +,  X ,  - , &div;</p><p>204 + 12  X  6  -  34 &div; 17 = 119</p><p>204 + 72  -  2 = 119</p><p>274 &#8800; 119</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (c) is incorrect.</p><p>Option (d): &div;, +,  X ,  - </p><p>204 &div; 12 + 6  X  34  -  17 = 119</p><p>17 + 204  -  17 = 119</p><p>204 &#8800; 119</p><p>LHS is not equal to RHS.</p><p>Thus, option (d) is incorrect.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If A denoted '+', B denoted 'x', C denoted '&div;' and D denoted '-', then what will come in place of '?' in the following equation?</p><p>24 B 3 A 85 D 456 C 8 = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; A &#2325;&#2379; '+' &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, B &#2325;&#2379; 'x' &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, C &#2325;&#2379; '&div;' &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2324;&#2352; D &#2325;&#2379; '-' &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; '?' &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366; ?</p><p>24 B 3 A 85 D 456 C 8 = ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">149</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">149</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">100</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">100</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">200</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">200</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">258</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">258</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>24 B 3 A 85 D 456 C 8 = ?</p><p>After replacing</p><p>24 x 3 + 85  -  456 &div; 8 = ?</p><p>72 + 85  -  57 = ?</p><p>? = 100</p>","marks":2,"section":null}]}